## ${workflow.replace(/^##\s+/, '')}

${antiPatterns}

${verification}

${examples}

## Progressive Disclosure

This skill follows progressive disclosure principles:

1. **Metadata** (name + description) — Always in context (~100 words)
2. **SKILL.md body** — Loaded when skill triggers
